Whale Pet (DSH-integrated edition)
=================================

This project is based on https://github.com/1190fasheqi/dafeiyu-pet
(MIT License). The original pet, sprites, and behavior are retained, and the
original copyright notice remains in the LICENSE file.

This edition adds a DSH (DeepSeek Harness) integration layer and a set of
supporting scripts:

  - balance.py          DeepSeek Open Platform balance query
  - voice.py            Voice announcements (edge-tts / Windows SAPI)
  - dsh_watch.py        DSH session state monitor
  - dsh_service.py      DSH process detection and launch
  - dsh_push.py         Phone notifications via ntfy
  - tools/synth_*.py    Voice audition/synthesis helper scripts
  - tools/preprocess.py, tools/preprocess2.py  Sprite remastering helpers
  - tools/make_zip.py   Source packaging helper

All new code is released under the same MIT License.
